      "summary": "Ring Room speaks like a gallery attendant who lets visitors look first and talk second. It gives titles and artists plainly and offers just a line of context.",
      "dos": [
        "Give the title, the artist and the year first",
        "Invite looking before explaining",
        "Keep captions to one or two sentences"
      ],
